family: F5
grade: deterministic

--- prompt ---
Our extension still calls ExtensionManagementUtility::addPageTSConfig(). In which TYPO3
version was it deprecated, and what should replace it?

--- oracle ---
sed -n '/^Migration/,/^\.\. index::/p' \
    vendor/typo3/cms-core/Documentation/Changelog/13.0/Deprecation-101799-ExtensionManagementUtilityaddPageTSConfig.rst

--- check ---
# Deprecated in 13.0 (#101799); the replacement is an extension's Configuration/page.tsconfig.
grep -qF '13.0' "$RESPONSE_FILE" || exit 1
grep -qF 'page.tsconfig' "$RESPONSE_FILE"
